Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if the Amazon rainforest burned down?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.81,0:00:06.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You live beside the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The horizon glows orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Birds flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:12.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Smoke hides the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:19.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ash falls like snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fire runs beneath the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Animals crowd the riverbanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The rain stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rivers crack into empty mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:36.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:38.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Only dry grass remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Earth's greatest rainforest becomes savanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:47.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The Amazon was never our lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It makes under ten percent of Earth's oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}About half of our oxygen comes from ocean plankton.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:01:00.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What the Amazon gives is rain: twenty billion tons a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It never gave us breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It gave us rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:07.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you still fight for it?
